{"id":"a6","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":6,"of":10,"title":"There is, there isn't","titleHe":"יֵשׁ וְאֵין","goal":"Say what exists and what doesn't.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"יֵשׁ means there is or there are — one word for both, since it doesn't change for number. Its opposite is אֵין."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"יֵשׁ סֵפֶר עַל הַשֻּׁלְחָן.","en":"There is a book on the table."},{"he":"יֵשׁ אֲנָשִׁים בַּבַּיִת.","en":"There are people in the house."},{"he":"אֵין קָפֶה.","en":"There's no coffee."},{"he":"אֵין מַיִם בַּבַּקְבּוּק.","en":"There's no water in the bottle."}]},{"type":"tip","body":"אֵין also does the work of isn't in a nominal sentence: הוּא אֵינוֹ מוֹרֶה, he is not a teacher — though in speech people simply say הוּא לֹא מוֹרֶה."}],"vocab":[{"he":"יֵשׁ","en":"there is, there are","translit":"yesh"},{"he":"אֵין","en":"there isn't","translit":"ein"},{"he":"עַל","en":"on","translit":"al"},{"he":"כָּאן","en":"here","translit":"kan"},{"he":"שָׁם","en":"there","translit":"sham"},{"he":"הַרְבֵּה","en":"a lot, many","translit":"harbe"},{"he":"קְצָת","en":"a little","translit":"ktsat"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["time","beginning","therefore","there is, there are"],"correct":3,"prompt":"יֵשׁ","translit":"yesh"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["there isn't","number","asks for","meaning"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אֵין","translit":"ein"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["on","they (archaic)","I (archaic)","arranged, tidy"],"correct":0,"prompt":"עַל","translit":"al"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["here","your (f.)","without","writing"],"correct":0,"prompt":"כָּאן","translit":"kan"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["with me","there","and he said","specifically, of all things"],"correct":1,"prompt":"שָׁם","translit":"sham"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["and he saw","heart (poetic)","my, mine","a lot, many"],"correct":3,"prompt":"הַרְבֵּה","translit":"harbe"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["give! (m.)","with me","sees","a little"],"correct":3,"prompt":"קְצָת","translit":"ktsat"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["עַל","כָּאן","שָׁם","אֵין"],"correct":1,"say":"כָּאן","he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["קְצָת","עַל","כָּאן","יֵשׁ"],"correct":0,"say":"קְצָת","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “there”?","options":["אָנֹכִי","שָׁם","שֶׁלָּךְ","מְדַבֵּר"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["הַרְבֵּה","אֵין","שָׁם","יֵשׁ"],"correct":3,"say":"יֵשׁ","he":true},{"type":"match","pairs":[["יֵשׁ","there is, there are"],["עַל","on"],["הַרְבֵּה","a lot, many"],["כָּאן","here"],["קְצָת","a little"]]},{"type":"read","he":"אֵין","translit":"ein","en":"there isn't"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “on”?","options":["דֶּלֶת","בֹּקֶר טוֹב","עַל","בֵּית חוֹלִים"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “there is, there are”?","options":["בָּתִּים","מַחְלִיט","תּוֹדָה","יֵשׁ"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “a lot, many”?","options":["מַכִּיר","הַרְבֵּה","טוֹב","גָּדוֹל"],"correct":1,"he":true}]}